{
    "title": "Offline Music Player & MP3",
    "description": "Music Player is a perfect <b>offline music player</b> for any Android, tailored for all music lovers. \ud83c\udfb5\r\n\r\nIt supports multiple audio formats, song lyrics, and music info editing. With professional <b>built-in equalizer</b>, Music Player offers an exclusive music experience for you!\r\n\r\nListen to music <b>without Wi-Fi</b>. Enjoy stylish themes and start a flawless audiovisual feast with this simple MP3 player FOR FREE!\r\n\r\n\r\nWHY CHOOSE US?\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Support All Audio Formats</b>\r\nMore than just an MP3 player, Music Player offers high-quality audio playback and supports MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, 3GP, OGC, etc. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa4 <b>Powerful Equalizer</b>\r\nCustomize your music experience with diverse presets: classical, dance, hip hop, jazz, etc. Music Player also features bass booster, reverb effects, and virtualizer to suit your personal tastes.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd70 <b>Ultimate Music Partner</b>\r\nWith Music Player, you can easily manage local tracks, create custom playlists, freely change album covers, and set songs as ringtone. It crafts personalized playlists based on your listening habits, such as Favorites and Top tracks; counts your listening hours and total played songs - the best partner for your music journey!\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Stylish UI & Themes</b>\r\nElevate your music enjoyment with a clean, user-friendly interface and stylish design. Personalize your own music space with 10+ free colorful themes and custom picture themes (coming soon).\r\n\r\n\r\nMAIN FEATURES\r\n\u25ba Offline audio player, enjoy music playback without internet\r\n\u25ba Deep scan & automatic music library refresh\r\n\u25ba Smart filter based on music duration and file size\r\n\u25ba Search, organize, and play songs via playlists, folders, albums, artists, and genres\r\n\u25ba Playlists for you: Recently played, My top tracks, My favorites\r\n\u25ba Add lyrics from both online and local\r\n\u25ba Support loop, shuffle, and repeat playback modes\r\n\r\nWE HAVE MORE!\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Playlists backup & restore\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Set songs as your ringtone\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Sleep timer with customizable playback duration\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Lock screen & background playback\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Edit song info: change song name, album cover, etc.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Start/pause playback via screen widgets or notification center\r\n\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in a world of HD music delight with our full-featured Offline Music Player & MP3. Download today for a sonic journey and elevate your music experience to new heights!\r\n\r\nIf you encounter any issues or have suggestions while using our app, feel free to reach out to us at \ud83d\udce7offlinemusicfeedback@gmail.com. We are dedicated to providing you with a better music experience!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Music Player is a perfect <b>offline music player</b> for any Android, tailored for all music lovers. \ud83c\udfb5<br><br>It supports multiple audio formats, song lyrics, and music info editing. With professional <b>built-in equalizer</b>, Music Player offers an exclusive music experience for you!<br><br>Listen to music <b>without Wi-Fi</b>. Enjoy stylish themes and start a flawless audiovisual feast with this simple MP3 player FOR FREE!<br><br><br>WHY CHOOSE US?<br><br>\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Support All Audio Formats</b><br>More than just an MP3 player, Music Player offers high-quality audio playback and supports MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, 3GP, OGC, etc. <br><br>\ud83c\udfa4 <b>Powerful Equalizer</b><br>Customize your music experience with diverse presets: classical, dance, hip hop, jazz, etc. Music Player also features bass booster, reverb effects, and virtualizer to suit your personal tastes.<br><br>\ud83e\udd70 <b>Ultimate Music Partner</b><br>With Music Player, you can easily manage local tracks, create custom playlists, freely change album covers, and set songs as ringtone. It crafts personalized playlists based on your listening habits, such as Favorites and Top tracks; counts your listening hours and total played songs - the best partner for your music journey!<br><br>\u2728 <b>Stylish UI &amp; Themes</b><br>Elevate your music enjoyment with a clean, user-friendly interface and stylish design. Personalize your own music space with 10+ free colorful themes and custom picture themes (coming soon).<br><br><br>MAIN FEATURES<br>\u25ba Offline audio player, enjoy music playback without internet<br>\u25ba Deep scan &amp; automatic music library refresh<br>\u25ba Smart filter based on music duration and file size<br>\u25ba Search, organize, and play songs via playlists, folders, albums, artists, and genres<br>\u25ba Playlists for you: Recently played, My top tracks, My favorites<br>\u25ba Add lyrics from both online and local<br>\u25ba Support loop,